      "side": 1,
      "message": "how about making this default? You can add `default: 0xff` here and drop it from the dtsi, I can\u0027t see a good reason to pad to 0x00 something that goes in flash or eeprom anyway.",
      "revId": "8e86c7b0aa8c2afed21d9a9632b615682987d824",
