        "id": 1190764
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-25T23:37:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmm... that doesn\u0027t work. it\u0027s behaving like 0xff is not specified,\nso essentially a no-op.\ni\u0027m guessing this default value doesn\u0027t make it down to binman?",
      "parentUuid": "9fa4fc3f_3868f52a",
      "revId": "8e86c7b0aa8c2afed21d9a9632b615682987d824",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
