      "writtenOn": "2023-08-29T19:18:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that your RO and RW sections setup the `pad-byte` property at different levels in the tree.\n\n```\nbinman/wp-ro/pad-byte\u003d\u003c0xff\u003e;\nbinman/ec-rw/rw-fw/pad-byte\u003d\u003c0xff\u003e;\n```\n\nIs this intentional?  If not, I recommend grouping the `pad-byte` property to be adjacent to the \u0027offset\u0027 and \u0027size\u0027 properties.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 68,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 68,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "8e86c7b0aa8c2afed21d9a9632b615682987d824",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
